From b80369a04d6740f0887a15b669fefa46637b9c01 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: logdog2325 <loganjayfisher@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 24 Jul 2026 13:17:17 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 03/22] Bundle XD OU Fixes cheat and open-source GBA BIOS in
 Sys

Ships the $XD OU Fixes Action Replay code in the default XD game INI
(not enabled by default; the netplay host enables it and the enabled
state syncs to guests) and Normmatt's open-source GBA BIOS in
Sys/GBA. GBACore falls back to the bundled BIOS when the user hasn't
configured one, so a fresh install needs no manual file setup.
---
