 Data/Sys/GameSettings/GXXE01.ini |   9 +++++++++
 Source/Core/Core/HW/GBACore.cpp  |  11 ++++++++++-
 3 files changed, 19 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)
 create mode 100644 Data/Sys/GBA/gba_bios.bin

